#* {{quote-book|ca|year=1980|year_published=2014|author=Joaquim Carbó|section=letter|title=Epistolari Jordi Arbonès & Joaquim Carbó|page=53|passage=De tant en tant deia alguna '''catalanada''', la qual cosa feia entendre que sabia on era.|t=Every once in a while I would say some '''Catalanism''', which meant that I knew where I was.}}

====Further reading====
* {{R:ca:IEC2}}
