# {{lb|ca|intransitive}} to [[fall]] {{gloss|to become}}
#: {{ux|ca|'''caure''' malalt|'''to fall''' ill}}
# {{lb|ca|intransitive}} to [[fall]], to [[collapse]] {{gloss|to be overthrown or defeated}}
# {{lb|ca|intransitive}} to be [[grant]]ed or [[award]]ed
# {{lb|ca|intransitive}} to [[fall on]] {{gloss|to occur on a particular day}}

