* subjunctive present: [[isca#Catalan|isca]], [[isques]], [[isca#Catalan|isca]], [[isquem]], [[isqueu]], [[isquen#Catalan|isquen]].
* subjunctive imperfect: [[isquera]]/[[isqués]], [[isqueres]]/[[isquesses]], [[isquera]]/[[isqués]], [[isquérem]]/[[isquéssem]], [[isquéreu]]/[[isquésseu]], [[isqueren]]/[[isquessen]]. 
* imperative: third person singular: [[isca]], first person plural: [[isquem]], third person plural: [[isquen]].
