#: {{ux|ca|'''Fins i tot''' un nen pot respondre aquesta pregunta.|'''Even''' a child can answer this question.}}
#: {{uxi|ca|És '''fins i tot''' pitjor del que es veu.|It's '''even''' worse than it looks.}}
#* {{quote-journal|ca|journal=Ara|title=10 coses que encara no sabem del cervell [10 things we still don't know about the brain]|date=Dec 12 2020|author=David Bueno
|passage= Si llavors es punxa la mà de goma, el subjecte percep una punxada que no ha rebut. Dit d’una altra manera, la nostra experiència de la realitat no es basa únicament en el que transmeten els sentits sinó també en les expectatives que tenim, i es veu molt influïda per les experiències prèvies i '''fins i tot''' per les creences.
|t=If the rubber hand is then pricked, the subject perceives a pinch that it hasn't received. In other words, our experience of reality isn't based solely on what our senses transmit but also in the expectations we have, and it's very influenced by our previous experiences and '''even''' by our beliefs.
|url=https://www.ara.cat/societat/10-coses-misteris-cervell-huma-neurociencia_0_2580941903.html}}

