{{head-lite|ca|articles|g=f|masculine|el|masculine plural|els|feminine plural|les}}

# [[the]]; {{n-g-lite|feminine singular definite article}}

=====Usage notes=====
The article {{m-lite|ca|la}} is contracted to '''''l'''''' before a vowel or ''h'', except before a following unstressed ''I'' or ''U'' sounds, as in la universitat, la idea, and la oliva. Note: Unstressed ''O'' sounds like a ''U''.

