====Usage notes====
This term was originally only a regional form of {{m|ca|glera}}, used in [[w:Ribagorça|Ribagorça]] and [[w:Baix Maestrat|Baix Maestrat]]. However, since the 1960s, it has become a widespread synonym of {{m|ca|llit fluvial}} ("riverbed"), also used outside these regions.

