Page 18063 mateix: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|mateix|mateix~meteix}}, from {{inh|ca|la-eme|metipse}}, from {{der|ca|la|-met}} + {{m|la|ipse}}. Compare {{cog|oc|meteis}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA|é}}
* {{rhymes|ca|ejʃ|s=2}}

===Adjective===
{{ca-adj}}

# {{non-gloss definition|serves as an intensifier in the same manner that in English would be performed by the appropriate [[reflexive pronoun]] (''myself'', ''himself'', ''themselves'', etc.)}}
#: {{ux|ca|Vostè '''mateix''' és responsable d'aquest desastre.|You '''yourself''' are responsible for this disaster.}}
#: {{ux|ca|El Sant Grial només pot ser tocat pels sants '''mateixos'''.|The Holy Grail may only be touched by the saints '''themselves'''.}}
#* {{quote-journal|ca|journal=Time Out Barcelona|column=Fight!|author=Jan Fleischer|date=Feb 13 2019|page=7
|passage=La meva bitmoji s'assembla més a mi que jo '''mateixa'''.
|t=My bitmoji looks more like me than I do.
|url=https://digitalarchive.timeout.com/Europe/Spain/Barcelona/2020/February/TOB_584/DVL/reader.html}}

====Usage notes====
As an adjective, ''mateix'' is placed after the noun it modifies.

===Determiner===
{{head|ca|determiner|g=m|feminine|mateixa|masculine plural|mateixos|feminine plural|mateixes}}

# [[same]] {{gloss|identical}}
#: {{ux|ca|Vam néixer el '''mateix''' dia.|We were born on the '''same''' day.}}
# [[same]] {{gloss|similar}}
# {{lb|ca|between a possessive pronoun and a noun}} [[own]]
#: {{ux|ca|El seu '''mateix''' pare no va creure el seu relat.|Her '''own''' father did not believe her tale.}}

====Usage notes====
As a determiner, ''mateix'' is placed before the noun it modifies.

===Derived terms===
{{col3|ca
|al mateix temps
|ara mateix
|tanmateix}}

===References===
* {{R:ca:DCVB}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:ca:IEC2}}
* {{R:ca:GDLC}}
* {{R:ca:DNV}}
