Page 19472 ne: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Balearic|Central}} {{IPA|ca|/nə/}}
* {{a|Valencian|Algherese}} {{IPA|ca|/ne/}}

===Pronoun===
{{ca-ppron|type=encl|encl_con='n|procl=en|procl_con=n'}}

# {{n-g|represents an indeterminate number or quantity of a given noun}}
# {{n-g|represents a place (associated with the action described by the verb) that would be introduced by the preposition {{m|ca|de}}}}
# {{n-g|replaces a phrase introduced by the preposition {{m|ca|de}}}}
# {{n-g|replaces the object of a [[causative]] verb}}

====Usage notes====
* ''ne'' cannot be used more than once as the object of a given verb.
* While ''ne'' is usually used to replace phrases beginning with the preposition {{m|ca|de}}, adverbial phrases (eg {{m|ca|de pressa}}) are replaced with {{m|ca|hi}}.
* ''ne'' is sometimes used instead of {{m|ca|ho}} to replace an adjective or indefinite noun as the predicate of a verb.
* ''ne'' is sometimes used popularly to add emphasis to a sentence: in this sense, it has no translation in English.
* {{U:ca:pronouns|form=full}}

====See also====
{{ca-decl-ppron}}

