Substantivization of the feminine of {{inh|ca|LL.|pariculus}}, diminutive of {{inh|ca|la|pār}}. Compare {{cog|es|pareja}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA|parêlla}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|f}}

# [[pair]] {{gloss|set of two people or animals intended to do something together}}
# [[couple]] {{gloss|set of two people in a relationship}}
#: {{uxi|ca|La Maria i el Joan fa poc que són '''parella'''.|Maria and Joan have only recently become mates.}}
# [[pair]] {{gloss|male and female of the same species}}
# [[significant other]]
#: {{uxi|ca|En Miquel és la '''parella''' de na Maria.|Miquel is Maria's mate.}}
# {{lb|ca|cards}} [[pair]] {{gloss|set of two cards with equal rank, but not necessarily the same suit}}
#: {{uxi|ca|Una '''parella''' d'asos.| A pair of aces.}}
# {{lb|ca|set theory}} [[pair]] {{gloss|each of the elements formed by the [[Cartesian product]] of two sets}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ca|unió estable de parella}}

===Adjective===
{{head|ca|adjective form}}

# {{feminine singular of|ca|parell}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:ca:IEC2}}
* {{R:ca:GDLC}}

-------- end text --------
