Page 21308 pegar: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ca|la|pico|picāre|t=smear with pitch}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{homophones|ca|pagar}}

===Verb===
{{ca-verb|root=cen:è; bal:é; val:é}}

# to [[hit]] somebody {{q|in order to harm}}
#: {{uxi|ca|Per què li '''pegueu''' a aquest noi?|Why are you '''hitting''' this boy?}}
# {{lb|ca|dialectal}} to [[hit]] one body with another
#: {{syn|ca|topar|xocar}}
#: {{uxi|ca|Vaig '''pegar''' de cap a la paret|I '''hit''' my head against the wall}}
# {{lb|ca|dialectal|used with {{l|ca|cop|t=knock}}, {{l|ca|empenta|t=shove}}, etc.}} to [[knock]], [[shove]] somebody
#: {{syn|ca|donar|q1=with ''cop'', ''empenta''|empènyer}}
#: {{uxi|ca|Li va '''pegar''' una empenta|He '''shoved''' her}}
# {{lb|ca|dialectal|used with {{l|ca|bot|t=jump}}, {{l|ca|salt|t=jump}} etc.}} to [[jump]]
#: {{syn|ca|donar|q1=with ''bot'', ''salt''|fer|q2=with ''bot'', ''salt''|saltar}}
#: {{uxi|ca|Va '''pegar''' un bot|He '''jumped'''}}
# {{lb|ca|dialectal}} to [[throw]], show sudden emotion
#: {{syn|ca|agafar}}
#: {{uxi|ca|Li va '''pegar''' una rabinadura al mig de la plaça|He '''threw''' a tantrum in the middle of the square}}
# {{lb|ca|dialectal}} to [[glue]]
#: {{syn|ca|enganxar|encolar}}

====Usage notes====
Words like "to jump", "to shove", "to knock" can be expressed in two ways. The first is with simple verbs (''saltar'', ''empènyer'', ''pegar''). The second is to use the construction with a verb roughly meaning "to make" plus indefinite article plus substantive (''fer un salt / donar un salt / '''pegar''' un salt, donar una empenta / '''pegar''' una empenta, donar un cop / '''pegar''' un cop'').

====Conjugation====
{{ca-conj}}

====Related terms====
{{col3|ca
|apegar
|pega
|pegar-se un toc a la barra
}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:ca:IEC2}}
* {{R:ca:GDLC}}
* {{R:ca:DNV}}
* {{R:ca:DCVB}}

