|passage=És una ximpleria i sé que tot està al meu cap, però les vegades que m'he assegut a un bar o a un restaurant a dinar sola –de sopar, ni parlar-ne!– em fa la impressió que la gent em mira i pensa "aix, '''pobreta'''".
|t=It's silly and I know it's all in my head, but the times that I've sat down at a bar or a restaurant to have lunch alone –dinner, there's no way!–, I get the feeling that people are looking at me and thinking, "ugh, '''poor thing'''."
|url=https://digitalarchive.timeout.com/Europe/Spain/Barcelona/2020/March/TOB_588/DVL/reader.html}}

