# {{archaic form of|ca|sense|t=without}}

====Usage notes====
This preposition has been superseded in all dialects by the form ''sense''. ''Sens'' is nowadays only used in poetry (for metrical reasons or for a deliberately archaizing effect), and in common set phrases: {{m|ca|sens dubte||without a doubt}} and {{m|ca|sens falta||without fail}}.

