{{inh+|ca|la|subtus}}, which gives the archaic preposition {{l|ca|sots}}, nowadays replaced by {{l|ca|sota}}.

===Pronunciation===
The prefix usually carries secondary stress ({{ca-IPA|sóts}}), but some speakers may realize is as completely unstressed (which in Central Catalan would lead to {{IPA|ca|/suts/}}).

