Page 26436 sou: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|sou}}~{{m|roa-oca|sol}}, from {{inh|ca|LL.|soldus}}, contraction of {{inh|ca|la|solĭdus}}. {{doublet|ca|sòlid}}. Compare {{cog|fr|sou}}.

