From {{m|ca|vós}} + {{m|ca|altres}}. Compare {{cog|oc|vosautres}}, {{cog|gl|vosoutros}}, {{cog|es|vosotros}}, {{cog|fr|vous autres}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{audio|ca|LL-Q7026 (cat)-Unjoanqualsevol-vosaltres.wav|Audio}}

===Pronoun===
{{ca-ppron}}

# [[you]] (plural)

====Usage notes====
* {{m|ca||Vosaltres}} is always used to address more than one person. Traditionally it was a familiar form, but in modern Catalan it is the usual, neutral form.

====Declension====
{{ca-decl-ppron}}

====See also====
* [[vostès]]
-------- end text --------
